# The core skips every system-origin write, even when a stage opted in.
MODULE: SystemOriginGateIgnoresOptIn
TARGET: SystemOriginGate
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: system-origin ingest is never intercepted
PERTURBS: Admit

--- FIND
    /\ IF Skips(reg, origin)
--- REPLACE
    /\ IF reg = "None" \/ origin = "System"
--- END
